e friction from the component. Flux is the ability to distort the path of an electron so that it arrives at the other end at a controlled rate. Current resistors create a bottleneck to slow down electron flow. Bottlenecks create pressure, friction, and heat. Gemstone capacitors bend the path of an electron with a lense so that the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":247431},{"name":"mshrieve/mshrieve","owner":"mshrieve","html_url":"https://github.com/mshrieve/mshrieve","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":247432},{"name":"Ada-Developers-Academy/corporate-training","owner":"Ada-Developers-Academy","html_url":"https://github.com/Ada-Developers-Academy/corporate-training","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":5,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":247433},{"name":"Ada-Developers-Academy/edteam-onboarding","owner":"Ada-Developers-Academy","html_url":"https://github.com/Ada-Developers-Academy/edteam-onboarding","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":4,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":247434},{"name":"nullcoder/nullcoder","owner":"nullcoder","html_url":"https://github.com/nullcoder/nullcoder","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":247435},{"name":"BolongZh/BolongZh","owner":"BolongZh","html_url":"https://github.com/BolongZh/BolongZh","stars":0,"forks":0,"